--- DECISION (plan sec.6) ---
  NONE. No doubled letter anywhere in this painting is written with XX, and the
  substitution census records no doubled-letter substitution of any kind.

  -> XX-for-OO is NOT a convention of this painting. The hypothesis collapses
     to its single-instance version and is graded
     [EXTERNAL/PROPOSED, UNSUPPORTED] -- the same grade as apple@20.
